SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

The MIT licence above covers ONLY the files authored in this repository:

    engine/     the quadro engine and its helper scripts and libraries
    docker/     the container recipe
    tools/      the build and run wrappers
    docs/       the documentation
    examples/   the example inputs and reference outputs

It does NOT and CANNOT cover the two external programs quadro depends on at
run time. Those are separately licensed and are deliberately absent from this
repository — you must obtain them yourself:

  • CYANA 2.1 — commercial licence, Dr. Peter Güntert.
  • Xplor-NIH — free of charge for non-profit institutions, but not
    redistributable.

Neither may be redistributed, and therefore neither may be baked into a Docker
image that you push to a public registry. See docs/THIRD-PARTY.md.
